ByteTrack-cpp
https://github.com/Vertical-Beach/ByteTrack-cpp

Vendored into SushiTrack as the reference implementation the regression
harness measures SushiTrack against. It is a C++ port by Vertical Beach of
ByteTrack, published in Python by Yifu Zhang and others at
https://github.com/ifzhang/ByteTrack. Both carry the MIT licence, reproduced
in LICENSE beside this file with both copyright lines.

Changed here: CMakeLists.txt, which points the build at the Eigen under
third_party/eigen and silences two MSVC conversion warnings.
